    LLM: "Since cards are dealt face-up, Phase 1 is pure luck. Strategy is restricted to side-betting if allowed.\n\nIn Phase 2, tracking which cards have been called helps you know how close your opponents are to calling 'Bingo'.\n\nSocial engineering: In games with larger pots, betting on and encouraging specific dealers can affect the pool, though the mechanics are mostly deterministic once cards are dealt.",
